WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:07.400
These past few days, this old subject met someone who might resolve our present dilemma.

00:08.400 --> 00:09.000
Who?

00:10.640 --> 00:13.000
The eldest daughter of the Chen clan, Chen Wan'er.

00:13.400 --> 00:22.000
A few days ago, Miss Chen sent an emissary to me with a single message: regarding this imperial marriage, she and Your Highness share the exact same stance.

00:22.560 --> 00:27.200
She refuses to marry. As to her reasons, this old subject knows not.

00:27.760 --> 00:33.000
I believe Your Highness should meet with her in person to uncover the truth.

00:59.640 --> 01:03.000
Prince of Jin... I almost failed to recognize you.

01:03.440 --> 01:07.800
Miss Chen harbors the daring spirit of a hero, yet was born into a woman's frame.
